{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026LtjvMUrLPS1793155843.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>本港樓價連升兩個月。</p><p></p><p>差餉物業估價署公布9月份私人住宅售價指數，按月升百分之0.1，與去年同期比較，升幅百分之9。</p><p></p><p>今年首9個月，樓價累升百分7。其中430平方呎以下的類別按月持平，430至752平方呎升近百分之0.2，753至1,075平方呎升百分之0.4。</p><p></p><p>租金指數方面，9月份按月上升百分之0.4，連升11個月，再創紀錄高位。與去年同期比較上升百分之6。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:42:07.384671+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T02:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T22:58:07.262357+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T03:38:19.718866+00:00","content_hash":"400749398660c0b7f9e5fa5f670337612c158dde195c485b3e24e183470d8628","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:42:07.384671+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}